By Tonelli's theorem and Plancherel's identity, $A\in L^1(\TT)$. Its Fourier coefficients are
	\begin{align*}
		\frac{1}{2\pi}\int_0^{2\pi}A(\om)e^{-\imath n\om}\,\d\om
