	\qandq
	\hat u \rightarrow u \eqdef \EE(\yp \xp).
}
For appropriately chosen $\la_n \rightarrow 0$, the estimator can converge as $n \rightarrow +\infty$ to the population parameter
\eq{
	\bar \be \in \uargmin{\be} \enscond{ J(\be) }{ C\be=u }.
}

